<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>

<section xml:id="sec-s07e07" xmlns:xi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XInclude">
  <title>Episode 7: Dividing with Variables</title>
  <assemblage>
    <title>Exponent Rules</title>
    <p>
      Here is a list of the three exponent rules in this episode
      <ol>
        <li>
          <p>
            <m>x^m x^n = x^{m+n}</m>
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <p>
            (x^a)^b = x^{a\cdot b}
          </p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <p>
            (xy)^p = x^p y^p
          </p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </p>
  </assemblage>
</section> 